_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 10
---
order: 10
---
short_label: II.10
---
statement: If a straight line is bisected, and a straight line is added to it in a straight line, then the square on the whole with the added straight line and the square on the added straight line both together are double the sum of the square on the half and the square described on the straight line made up of the half and the added straight line as on one straight line. <font color=a00044>
---
proof:
---
body:
